# Cloudflare Workers Assets ignore — files here are NOT uploaded.
# Cloudflare hard-caps any single asset at 25 MiB; ONE oversized file
# aborts the ENTIRE `wrangler deploy`, which is why production was
# frozen on a stale build for so long. Keep big/non-runtime files out
# of the upload (they still stay on disk locally).

# The minify backup written mid-deploy (build.mjs → .index.dev.html). It's the
# full ~12 MB un-minified SOURCE; restore() deletes it locally, but wrangler
# uploads whatever is present during the deploy window, so exclude it here to
# stop the raw source shipping to the CDN.
.index.dev.html

# Full data-export dumps — never needed by the deployed game.
assets/Exports/

# Marketing-site flood video that keeps getting dropped into the game's
# Backgrounds folder. 36 MB, unused by the game, and over the 25 MiB cap.
assets/background/Backgrounds/websitefloodvideo.mp4

# `assets/3d models/` is the raw-model STAGING folder — .glb sources keep getting
# dropped here (Battletable 32.9 MiB, Vendor market cash register 53.4 MiB, …) and
# any one over 25 MiB aborts the whole deploy. Big .glb models for the walkable
# Card Shop belong in the Supabase `models` Storage bucket (upload via the in-shop
# "🛠 Edit Shop" / "🏗️ Build" admin panels), NOT the Pages bundle — Cloudflare
# can't serve a file this large anyway. Ignore EVERY .glb in this folder; the PNG
# textures next to them (under the cap) still deploy normally. Files stay on disk.
# NOTE: also ignore .glb in SUBfolders (e.g. "3d models/posters/Birth Of Universe
# 1.glb" — 41.9 MiB) — the single-* pattern only matches direct children, so a
# model dropped into a subfolder slipped through and aborted the whole deploy.
assets/3d models/*.glb
assets/3d models/**/*.glb

# Belt-and-suspenders: ANY .glb anywhere in the bundle. Runtime 3D models are
# served from the Supabase `models` Storage bucket, never the Pages upload.
**/*.glb

# EXCEPTION: the default Card Shop binder model ships in the bundle (it's the
# fixture EVERY shop gets, so it can't depend on a per-owner Storage upload).
# 14.8 MiB — comfortably under Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-asset cap.
!assets/3d models/Binder table.glb

# Belt-and-suspenders: any other oversized model formats that land in assets.
*.glb.zip

# Safety net: raw editor zips / source bundles sometimes land in assets.
*.zip

# Oversized source audio dropped into assets/Audio/ (added 2026-06-17, each
# ~50-100 MiB — over the 25 MiB cap, and not referenced by the game). Cloudflare
# can't serve a file this large anyway; if this ambience is wanted in-game,
# compress it under 25 MiB or host it in the cloud bucket. Small served SFX in
# this folder (button click.wav, card draw.wav, …) stay under the cap and deploy
# normally, so exclude only the oversized ones by exact name. Files stay on disk.
assets/Audio/Heavy Machines - Factory Ambience.wav
assets/Audio/auction chatter.wav
assets/Audio/fishing.wav
# 73 MiB main-menu music WAV dropped 2026-06-18 — not referenced by index.html and
# over the cap. To use it in-game, compress to MP3/OGG well under 25 MiB and load
# that instead. File stays on disk.
assets/Audio/Main menu music.wav

# Oversized animated unit frame dropped 2026-07-23 (113 MiB — 4.5× over the 25 MiB
# cap; a single oversized file aborts the ENTIRE deploy). Animated-GIF unit frames
# must be compressed/resized under 25 MiB (or converted to a sprite sheet) before
# they can ship. Small GIFs under the cap still deploy normally, so exclude only
# this one by exact name. File stays on disk.
assets/Units/unit frames/New units/Grey Dragon Animate rare.gif

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ✅ COMPRESSED RUNTIME MODELS — re-included 2026-08-19.
# The blanket `**/*.glb` above STAYS. It is the guard that stopped an oversized
# drop aborting the entire deploy (see the header), and removing it would just
# wait for the next 70 MiB model to freeze production again. Instead each model
# that has been through `gltf-transform optimize --compress draco` and VERIFIED
# under the 25 MiB cap is re-included BY NAME below.
#
# Uncompressed masters live in `assets-source/glb-masters/` (outside the deploy
# root, byte-verified before any write). To add a model here: compress it,
# confirm `gltf-transform inspect` reports unchanged mesh/material counts,
# confirm it is under 25 MiB, then add one `!` line. Do not relax the blanket.
#
# ⚠ These are DRACO-compressed. Any page that loads one MUST wire a DRACOLoader
# into its GLTFLoader or the load throws. index.html already does; pack-opener
# and ascent-map were wired in the same commit that added these lines.
!assets/Boosterandpacks/Glb/Booster boxes.glb
!assets/Boosterandpacks/Glb/BOU! pack.glb
!assets/gib files/Prince The adam Changer.glb
!assets/gib files/The Tour Guide.glb
!assets/3d models/Man eacthing plant statue.glb
!assets/3d models/packopening shelf.glb
!assets/3d models/cardshelf.glb
!assets/3d models/Bahamut statue.glb
!assets/3d models/Mythci deck.glb
!assets/3d models/Vendor market cash register.glb
!assets/3d models/base chair.glb
!assets/3d models/cindercore.glb
!assets/3d models/abandontank.glb
!assets/3d models/posters/Birth Of Universe 1.glb
!assets/3d models/Base survivor bed.glb
!assets/3d models/sircedric statue.glb
!assets/3d models/prn nodes.glb
!assets/3d models/Battletable.glb
!assets/3d models/ruin house 1.glb
